kind: import
description: |
  brussels-winblues xfconf system defaults: Chicago95 GTK, icon, cursor,
  window-decoration and notification themes, and a single bottom panel
  with a Start menu, task list, tray and clock. Every property is declared
  against the upstream default in tests/xfce-policy.yml; see
  docs/winblues.md.

sources:
- kind: local
  path: files/winblues
